[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Reset This Computer (Keep My Files)
GenericName=Fresh start without losing your files
Comment=Remove the apps added since the first day, repair Secure Linux and start with fresh desktop settings. Your files are kept.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/secure-linux-reset
Icon=edit-undo
Terminal=true
Categories=System;Settings;
Keywords=reset;fresh start;factory;clean;repair;restore;keep files;
